OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786915122
OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,FPolice have said they are treating
OL,7,Fseveral incidents of items being
OL,8,Fplaced on bonfires in Londonderry as
OL,9,F"sectarian-motivated hate crimes".
OL,11,FA senior officer said flags, poppy
OL,12,Fwreaths, banners, political material,
OL,13,Fsashes and football shirts were among
OL,14,Fthe items placed on the pyres.
OL,16,FSinn Fein has condemned the burning of
OL,17,Fimages of First Minister Michelle
OL,18,FO'Neill on one of the fires.
OL,26,@kD@GrrqD@AOUqD@aO]xD@Grr
