PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786915122
OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,FThe party's north Belfast MP John
OL,7,FFinucane described the actions as
OL,8,F"anti-democratic and anti-republican".
OL,10,FBonfires are traditionally lit in
OL,11,Fnationalist areas of Derry on August
OL,12,F15.
OL,14,FThe fires are associated with the
OL,15,FAugust anniversary of the introduction
OL,16,Fof internment without trial during the
OL,17,FTroubles, and also coincide with the
OL,18,FCatholic Feast of the Assumption.
OL,20,FSeveral bonfires were lit in the city
OL,21,Fon Saturday evening.
OL,26,@kD@GrrpD@AOUpD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
