FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786915122
OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,FDepartment for Infrastructure staff
OL,7,Fhad previously removed pallets and
OL,8,Fpoppy wreaths from a bonfire in the
OL,9,FBogside area.
OL,11,FChief Superintendent Gillian Kearney,
OL,12,FPSNI Commander of Derry City and
OL,13,FStrabane, said: "There were a number
OL,14,Fof bonfires in the city on Saturday 15
OL,15,FAugust; in Bligh's Lane in Creggan, on
OL,16,FLecky Road in the Bogside and on
OL,17,FCorrody Road in the Top of the Hill
OL,18,Farea of the Waterside.
OL,26,@kD@GrruD@QOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786915122
OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,F"Material placed on these bonfires
OL,7,Fincluded flags, poppy wreaths,
OL,8,Fbanners, political material, sashes,
OL,9,Ffootball shirts and other items.
OL,11,F"These are being treated as sectarian-
OL,12,Fmotivated hate crimes.
OL,14,F"Additionally, during an operation on
OL,15,F13 August, led by the Department for
OL,16,FInfrastructure to remove pallets from
OL,17,Funderneath the Lecky flyover in the
OL,18,FBogside, a number of other items were
OL,19,Funcovered.
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@AOUsD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
