PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786915122
OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,F"These included six poppy wreaths and
OL,7,Fa World War One commemoration banner."
OL,9,FMs Kearney added: "Police inquiries in
OL,10,Frespect of how these items came to be
OL,11,Fthere are under way and as part of
OL,12,Finquiries to establish their
OL,13,Fownership, we appeal to anyone who
OL,14,Fbelieves any of the wreaths or the
OL,15,Fbanner belongs to them, to call us on
OL,16,F101, quoting reference RM26049446, to
OL,17,Freclaim them.
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@AOUoD@fO]qD@SOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
