PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786915122
OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,F"Inquiries are ongoing in relation to
OL,7,Fall of these incidents, and all
OL,8,Foffences will be investigated
OL,9,Faccordingly."
OL,11,FThe senior officer said: "The material
OL,12,Fplaced on bonfires in the city is
OL,13,Fdisgraceful, and is to be condemned.
OL,15,F"It will have no impact on the work we
OL,16,Fdo every single day to make a
OL,17,Fdifference and help the communities we
OL,18,Fserve."
OL,26,@kD@GrrnD@AOUqD@MO]sD@ZOUwD@AOUzD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/10
