OL,3,CSinn Fein condemn burning of images of
OL,4,CFirst Minister on bonfire
OL,6,FPolice had previously attributed
OL,7,Fdisorder in Derry on Wednesday
OL,8,Fevening, which had included a petrol
OL,9,Fbomb being thrown at officers, to the
OL,10,Fearlier removal of material from a
OL,11,Fbonfire site in the Bogside.
